          "worked": "$B^c=\\{0,2,4,6\\}$ within $U$.\n$$\\begin{align*}A\\cup B^c&=\\{1,2,5,6\\}\\cup\\{0,2,4,6\\}\\\\A\\cup B^c&=\\{0,1,2,4,5,6\\}.\\end{align*}$$",
